{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/367296-what-happens-if-a-pact-maker-talks-to-the-person-s-he-gave-up","id":367296,"title":"What happens if a pact maker talks to the person(s) he gave up?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-12T06:33:39-08:00","id":367296,"title":"What happens if a pact maker talks to the person(s) he gave up?","content":"Let's say Bob, sells his friend, Joe for a promotion. He gets his promotion and eventually decides he wants Joe back in his life. He tells a mutual best friend the story, fully expecting neither to remember the friendship with Joe. The mutual friend puts him back in touch with Joe. What are the consequences of this regarding the pact? the demon? anything else important?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T07:02:54-08:00","id":367329,"title":"","content":"Without finding and destroying the pact document, or buying his friendship back from the demon, that old relationship isn't coming back. I wouldn't say that prevents a new relationship from forming; he hasn't sold the <i>capability</i> to befriend Joe. But he's going to start from scratch, Joe's not going to remember him, and the new friendship is going to exist in an entirely different context, without the history they had shared before. It's a new, separate relationship.<br /> <br /> There's probably a demon out there somewhere who thinks he's really clever making deals with humans to create relationships for pact harvesting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T19:33:43-08:00","id":368177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/367296-what-happens-if-a-pact-maker-talks-to-the-person-s-he-gave-up?p=367329#post367329\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There's probably a demon out there somewhere who thinks he's really clever making deals with humans to create relationships for pact harvesting.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of them is in my troupe. Another trick he found was finding people that have been dumped by their significant others, buying the failed relationship, wiping the target's memory of the person clean, and giving the client a second chance at the relationship, this time with knowledge of what didn't work. Slightly creepy as the person is now pursuing them under false pretenses, but hey, they're not called demons for nothing.<br /> <br /> Additionally, buyer's remorse can be a demon's best friend if a client tries to buy back something back: &quot;No refunds, only exchanges friend.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2233-agentwestmer","name":"Agentwestmer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2233_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-12T19:45:19-08:00","id":368185,"title":"","content":"Oh God, I just had a horrible, deranged flash of an idea. A demon that pretends to be a &quot;pro-life&quot; protestor, uses Embeds to brutally manipulate one of the women the group is harassing, then taking her aside and offering to make the unwanted fetus just 'go away'. Or, they insinuate themselves into one of those groups, and take away an abortion that one of the members deeply regrets, or gives them a second chance by working multiple pacts. Buying an unwanted fetus from an expectant mother, and selling it to one who wants to make expunge their former &quot;shame&quot;, or one who can't conceive otherwise.<br /> <br /> ... I'm not entirely sure if this is brilliant or just twisted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-13T00:45:34-08:00","id":368393,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/367296-what-happens-if-a-pact-maker-talks-to-the-person-s-he-gave-up?p=368185#post368185\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh God, I just had a horrible, deranged flash of an idea. A demon that pretends to be a &quot;pro-life&quot; protestor, uses Embeds to brutally manipulate one of the women the group is harassing, then taking her aside and offering to make the unwanted fetus just 'go away'. Or, they insinuate themselves into one of those groups, and take away an abortion that one of the members deeply regrets, or gives them a second chance by working multiple pacts. Buying an unwanted fetus from an expectant mother, and selling it to one who wants to make expunge their former &quot;shame&quot;, or one who can't conceive otherwise.<br /> <br /> ... I'm not entirely sure if this is brilliant or just twisted.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'd say it's both brilliant and twisted. If your group is willing to play with that dark a theme, it actually also makes a good way to explain demon-blooded children that might appear outside of a deliberate demon bloodline. A baby is a living thing so hypothetically it will need to be transported to be removed from one woman and applied to the other. It could be &quot;stored&quot; on a female cover, to continue growth, until it can be moved to a &quot;buyer&quot;. This, I imagine, would imbue the baby with demon power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3036-desolatedolly","name":"DesolateDolly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3036_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"179"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}